WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:23.958
I must go.

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:02.625
What are you…

00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:04.667
-Simon?
-Do you want me to stop?

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:06.375
Siena…

00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:08.500
come back to me.

00:02:18.792 --> 00:02:19.833
It seems the two of us

00:02:19.917 --> 00:02:21.625
are finally seeing
eye-to-eye on something.

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.375
I suppose we are.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.250
Someone may hear us,
my lord.

00:03:10.542 --> 00:03:11.958
Whatever will
the staff think?

00:03:12.042 --> 00:03:13.667
It does not matter.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.375
Come with me.

00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:09.250
It's magical, Brother.

